Phase 2 is complete and verified.

Proceed to Phase 3 of ContextPilot.

Phase 3 goal:

Build the ContextPilot context-ranking and context-optimization engine.

This is the core intelligence layer of the product.

The objective is NOT simply to find files matching keywords.

The objective is:

> Given a developer task and a repository, determine the smallest set of repository context that is sufficient for an AI coding agent to understand and safely implement the task.

The system must optimize for token efficiency while protecting correctness.

Do NOT implement the Claude Code plugin yet.

Do NOT implement Git intelligence yet.

Do NOT implement external LLM/embedding APIs.

Everything in this phase must remain local and deterministic.

---

